334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Barriers to translating diabetes research results into policy and ideas for overcoming these barriers was explored by the University of Geneva through a series of interviews with key informants from all over the world. These included policy makers, research funders, managers of research institutions and diabetes advocates. The results of these interviews were presented and discussed at a workshop organized in 2023, with the aim to get insight from various stakeholders on how to attract the interest of different audiences and policy makers in important unresolved diabetes scientific issues.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [37]
>>
endobj
