endobj
338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (There is a lack of understanding of diabetes by policymakers outside of the health area. The interviewees also highlighted that for policymakers, diabetes is a complex issue requiring multiple areas to be addressed in parallel.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
